00:09:58,990 --> 00:10:01,000
Hm? Yeah...

2006
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:04,500
Morikawa, what else did you wish for?

2007
00:10:04,500 --> 00:10:09,980
My family's health and Yoriko's, 
and a prayer for Natsume-san's success on her exam.

2008
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:11,260
How about you, Soma-kun?

2009
00:10:11,670 --> 00:10:13,760
I, um...

2010
00:10:13,760 --> 00:10:15,510
I guess I'll tell ya later.

2011
00:10:16,260 --> 00:10:17,760
Soma-kun?

2012
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:21,430
Anyway, it sucks that those three suddenly 
canceled on us at the last minute, huh?

2013
00:10:21,850 --> 00:10:25,190
A cold, house chores, 
and entrance exams. It can't be helped.

2014
00:10:26,150 --> 00:10:29,190
Yeah... I guess so.

2015
00:10:35,700 --> 00:10:37,200
Sorry to keep you waiting.

2016
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:39,120
Did you finish your house chores?

2017
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:41,620
Are you putting off studying for your entrance exam?

2018
00:10:41,620 --> 00:10:45,210
Not at all. Praying for my success 
on the exam is important, too, right?

2019
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:46,920
What's wrong?

2020
00:10:48,630 --> 00:10:49,630
Well...

2021
00:10:49,630 --> 00:10:51,760
Is Mina-san going to the shrine, too?

2022
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:52,800
Onee-chan!

2023
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:54,680
I haven't seen you in forever, Eita-kun!

2024
00:10:55,220 --> 00:10:56,180
Hello.

2025
00:10:56,180 --> 00:11:01,060
You didn't recognize me when we ran into each other,
 so how come you recognized her immediately?

2026
00:11:01,060 --> 00:11:03,770
Mina-san hasn't changed a bit.

2027
00:11:03,770 --> 00:11:07,350
You should tell me I've gotten prettier!

2028
00:11:07,350 --> 00:11:09,320
Okay, you've gotten prettier.

2029
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:12,230
Mio's gotten cuter, right?

2030
00:11:13,150 --> 00:11:16,780
Geez. You came out to buy some wasabi, didn't you?

2031
00:11:16,780 --> 00:11:19,780
Oh, you're right! Later!

2032
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:22,330
Take care of Mio, 'kay?

2033
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:29,340
You're not giving me a compliment.

2034
00:11:29,340 --> 00:11:30,840
Hmph...

2035
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:33,960
Oh, there you are!

2036
00:11:34,420 --> 00:11:36,970
Wow, this place is far.

2037
00:11:36,970 --> 00:11:38,470
Uh...

2038
00:11:39,050 --> 00:11:41,190
Sorry, am I late?

2039
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:43,470
No.

2040
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:43,470
No.

2041
00:11:48,100 --> 00:11:50,690
I'm not gonna drink sake anymore.

2042
00:11:50,690 --> 00:11:53,030
I've heard you say that more than a hundred times.

2043
00:11:56,570 --> 00:12:00,570
What is this? Are you making 
a photography book of your boyfriend or something?

2044
00:12:02,160 --> 00:12:05,080
No, I don't have a boyfriend.

2045
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:07,410
You've got a boring high school life.

2046
00:12:07,410 --> 00:12:10,380
It's fine if I'm interesting now.

2047
00:12:15,050 --> 00:12:17,300
<i>Happy New Year!</i>

2048
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:21,550
After all, I'll never let my club disband.

